{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_0517F0","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"AI朝相反方向进化，是什么意思？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":44,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"就是作为系统存在、专门处理海量信息的AI。那里没有人类的智能，也没有思考和感情。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":116,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"它不会建立作为个体的自我，而是通过作为群体行动来展现社会性的机器。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":99,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"像蜜蜂一样？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":18,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"没错。把每个个体收集的信息综合起来，决定整个群体的行动。就像蜜蜂往返于蜂巢和花田之间。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":129,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"为此，把AI网络化将会非常重要。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":44,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"说不上来为什么……感觉很诡异。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":45,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":7,"cn_text":"不过，要控制社会的话，这种形式反而更合适。因为它可以只放行想让其流通的信息。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":114,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":8,"cn_text":"当然，对这种毫无浪漫可言的AI，我可提不起兴趣。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":68,"review_flag":""}]}